2026-07-27T08:28:17.2098422Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2163645Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2164190Z i /tmp/RtmpMetrqY/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2164550Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2164982Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2165586Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2166188Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2167067Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2167730Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2422439Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2534638Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:28:17.2977813Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:28:17.3136275Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
